348,"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."],[349,"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."],[388,"**`Field`** — stacks a field's label, control, description, and error in one consistently spaced column (pure layout — a `Flex` column with the standard field gap)."],[393,"**`FieldButton`** — an actionable control placed inside the box, such as the NumberField steppers or a search submit (a click target within the group)."],[395,"**`FieldDescription`** — helper text that explains the field; renders nothing when empty (wraps the antares `Text` with `slot=\"description\"`)."],[396,"**`FieldError`** — surfaces the field's validation messages when it is invalid, and nothing when valid (a thin wrapper over React Aria `FieldError`)."],[390,"**`FieldGroup`** — the bordered box that visually unites a field's controls and reflects their shared focus, disabled, and invalid state. Used only by \"boxed\" fields (TextField, NumberField, Select, DateField); presentationally it is a React Aria `Group`."],[391,"**`FieldInput`** — the single-line control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `Input` given antares spacing via `Box`)."],[389,"**`FieldLabel`** — names the field and flags whether it's required (wraps React Aria `Label`, rendering an optional `*` indicator)."],[392,"**`FieldTextArea`** — the multiline control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `TextArea` given antares spacing via `Box`)."],[394,"**`FieldTrigger`** — a full-width value-display button inside the box that opens an overlay (used by Select and DatePicker): a value area plus a trailing icon, laid out across the group. `variant=\"select\"` is transparent and input-like; `variant=\"control\"` is a filled segment inside a shared group."],[473,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[472,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[480,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[481,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[479,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[821,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[460,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1347,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[465,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1197,"**Adornments**: Optional `leadingText` and `trailingText` for fixed text before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`)"],[937,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1258,"**Arrow Left / Right**"],[1010,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[637,"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"],[752,"**Arrow Up** / **Arrow Down** (or **Up** / **Down**): increase or decrease by `step`"],[636,"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"],[938,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[1363,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[457,"**Automatic caching**: Once loaded, icons are cached for optimal performance"],[512,"**Automatic Caching**: Once loaded, the icon is cached in memory to a